 s New Face\, performed on Comedy Central Featuring and The Drew Barrymore S
 how\, and appeared on Watch What Happens Live With Andy Cohen\, Howard Ster
 n\, and more. His first two solo shows were acclaimed at the Edinburgh Frin
 ge Festival and his third\, Sugar Daddy\, extended Off-Broadway four times 
